  message: "Split out of WI-pubiv in Phase-7 over-fold reconciliation (the audit flagged WI-pubiv's 1670-node finding as over-folding two distinct mechanisms). THIS item = the real producer bug: on 22 synthetic nodes the node.id kind-slot encodes a ROLE the kind field does not carry — route->function 8 (starlette route-registration nodes, e.g. id '...:route' / kind 'function' / name 'starlette:_health'), event_subscriber->function 11, event_publisher->function 3. Distinct fix: the producer should carry the role in a dedicated field or normalize the id kind-slot to match node.kind. Evidence: frozen substrate.json (tranche-05 F84.A1). Priority P2 by analogy to the parent finding (blind sev 3); not independently blind-judged. Sibling/remainder: WI-pubiv now retains the external_symbol id-kind normalization (~1645 nodes, arguably-expected)."  # 8330
